{"ticker":"ADM","updated":"2026-10-30T22:32:24Z","profile":{"longName":"Archer-Daniels-Midland Company","shortName":"Archer-Daniels-Midland Company","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Farm Products","country":"United States","website":"https://www.adm.com","fullTimeEmployees":40798,"marketCap":37067513856,"trailingPE":21.071234,"forwardPE":13.547505,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.45149773,"pegRatio":0.91,"targetMeanPrice":80.3,"targetHighPrice":95.0,"targetLowPrice":60.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":10,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.072,"earningsGrowth":3.156,"grossMargins":0.0687,"operatingMargins":0.04008,"profitMargins":0.021559998,"totalRevenue":82099003392,"beta":0.629,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":88.75,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":55.58,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.73},"summary":"Archer-Daniels-Midland Company provides human and animal nutrition ingredients and solutions in the United States, Switzerland, the Cayman Islands, Brazil, Mexico, Canada, the United Kingdom, and internationally. It operates in three segments: Ag Services and Oilseeds; Carbohydrate Solutions; and Nutrition. The company engages in the origination, merchandising, transportation, and storage of agricultural raw materials, as well as the crushing and processing of oilseeds, including soybeans and soft seeds, such as cottonseed, sunflower seed, canola, rapeseed, and flaxseed; produces and markets vegetable oils and oilseed protein meals used by food, feed, energy, and industrial customers; sale of crude and partially refined vegetable oils; supplies peanuts and peanut-derived ingredients; and manufactures cotton cellulose pulp. It is also involved in the grain sourcing, handling, and multimodal transportation network supporting import, export, and distribution activities; structured trade finance activities; corn and wheat wet and dry milling and related processing activities; production of distillers' grains, corn gluten feed, and corn gluten meal for use as animal feed ingredients; and carbon capture and sequestration and other emissions-reduction initiatives. In addition, the company engages in the creation, manufacturing, sale, and distribution of an array of ingredients and sol","summary_zh":"阿徹丹尼爾斯米德蘭公司在美國、瑞士、開曼群島、巴西、墨西哥、加拿大、英國和國際上提供人類和動物營養成分和解決方案。該公司分為三個部門：農業服務部門和油籽部門；碳水化合物溶液；和營養。該公司從事農業原料的生產、銷售、運輸和儲存，以及油籽的壓榨和加工，包括大豆和軟籽，如棉籽、葵花籽、油菜籽、油菜籽和亞麻籽；生產和銷售食品、飼料、能源和工業客戶使用的植物油和油籽蛋白粉；銷售粗製和部分精煉的植物油；供應花生和花生衍生原料；它還涉及支持進口、出口和分銷活動的糧食採購、裝卸和多式聯運網路；結構性貿易融資活動；玉米和小麥濕磨和乾磨及相關加工活動；生產酒糟、玉米蛋白飼料和用作動物飼料成分的玉米蛋白粉；碳捕獲和封存以及其他減排舉措。此外，該公司還從事一系列成分和溶膠的創造、製造、銷售和分銷","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"農產品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":62.55,"h":62.81,"l":61.62,"c":62.05,"v":3837800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":61.76,"h":61.78,"l":61.12,"c":61.72,"v":3028500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":61.88,"h":62.19,"l":61.34,"c":61.94,"v":2691200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":61.94,"h":63.03,"l":61.65,"c":62.94,"v":2656400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":62.84,"h":63.25,"l":61.39,"c":62.3,"v":4161500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":62.35,"h":62.72,"l":62.06,"c":62.19,"v":2316900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":62.02,"h":62.24,"l":59.57,"c":61.41,"v":3606200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":61.37,"h":61.68,"l":60.79,"c":61.42,"v":2909300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":61.3,"h":61.77,"l":61.16,"c":61.57,"v":2289900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":61.4,"h":61.6,"l":60.51,"c":60.53,"v":3085800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":60.77,"h":62.92,"l":59.92,"c":62.35,"v":4665400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":62.15,"h":62.63,"l":61.06,"c":61.09,"v":3084000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":61.27,"h":61.27,"l":60.63,"c":60.83,"v":2837700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":60.9,"h":61.88,"l":60.74,"c":61.65,"v":11658500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":61.23,"h":61.33,"l":58.46,"c":59.86,"v":4342500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":59.91,"h":61.6,"l":59.91,"c":60.7,"v":3624600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":61.03,"h":62.05,"l":60.91,"c":61.48,"v":2537600},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":61.99,"h":62.28,"l":61.02,"c":61.07,"v":2939400},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":61.31,"h":61.54,"l":59.36,"c":60.6,"v":5878800},{"t":"202