y connecting local needs with global capabilities. ADM is also a premier human and animal nutrition provider, as well as a leader in health and well-being products.","zh":"阿徹丹尼爾斯米德蘭公司及其子公司（“公司”或“ADM”）釋放自然的力量，並豐富生活品質。該公司是重要的全球農業供應鏈管理者和加工商，透過將當地需求與全球能力相結合來提供糧食安全。 ADM 也是首屈一指的人類和動物營養供應商，以及健康和福祉產品領域的領導者。"},{"en":"The Company partners with thousands of farmers around the world to purchase their crops and uses its integrated global origination, logistics, and manufacturing network to transform many of those raw commodities into an expansive array of products serving the food, feed, fuel, and industrial and consumer products sectors. The Company offers a broad portfolio of food and beverage products, from staple foods to innovative alternatives, such as natural colors and flavors, plant-based proteins, and lower-sugar, fat, and salt solutions. ADM provides human and animal nutrition ingredients and solutions that support health, productivity, and sustainability. It offers a wide range of health and well-being products, such as probiotics, enzymes, and supplements to meet the needs of consumers looking for new ways to live healthier lives. ADM is a key producer of biofuels, converting agricultural fe","zh":"該公司與世界各地成千上萬的農民合作購買農作物，並利用其一體化的全球原產地、物流和製造網路將許多原材料轉化為服務於食品、飼料、燃料以及工業和消費品行業的廣泛產品。該公司提供廣泛的食品和飲料產品組合，從主食到創新替代品，如天然色素和香料、植物蛋白以及低糖、低脂肪和低鹽解決方案。 ADM 提供支持健康、生產力和永續發展的人類和動物營養成分和解決方案。它提供廣泛的健康和福祉產品，例如益生菌、酵素和補充劑，以滿足尋求更健康生活新方式的消費者的需求。 ADM 是生物燃料的主要生產商，將農業轉化為燃料"},{"en":"ADM also has significant investments in certain entities and joint venture arrangements that aim to expand or enhance the market for its products or offer other benefits including, but not limited to, geographic or product-line expansion.","zh":"ADM 也對某些實體和合資企業進行了大量投資，旨在擴大或增強其產品市場或提供其他好處，包括但不限於地理或產品線擴展。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The Company has significant competition in the markets in which it operates based principally on price, foreign exchange rates, quality, global supply, and alternative products, some of which are made from different raw materials than those utilized by the Company. Given the commodity-based nature of many of its businesses, the Company, on an ongoing basis, focuses on managing unit costs and improving efficiency through technology improvements, productivity enhancements, and regular evaluation of the Company's asset portfolio. The Company's Nutrition business is a vertically integrated business that provides ingredients and solutions for humans and animals in a highly competitive environment with a variety of companies offering the same products and services. The industry includes ingredient suppliers, contract manufacturers, global fast moving consumer goods companies, and private label","zh":"該公司在其經營的市場中存在著激烈的競爭，主要基於價格、外匯匯率、品質、全球供應和替代產品，其中一些產品是由與公司使用的原材料不同的原材料製成的。鑑於其許多業務以商品為基礎的性質，公司持續致力於透過技術改進、生產力提高和定期評估公司資產組合來管理單位成本和提高效率。該公司的營養業務是一家垂直整合的業務，在高度競爭的環境中為人類和動物提供原料和解決方案，多家公司提供相同的產品和服務。該行業包括原料供應商、合約製造商、全球快速消費品公司和自有品牌"},{"en":"The Company's R&D efforts focus on creating science-based products, solutions, and technologies aligned with macro trends in food security, sustainable processes, health, and personalized nutrition. Within innovation centers across three continents, the R&D team is closely connected to customers and the global markets. The Company strategically invests in R&D across the entire nutrition value chain by leveraging its access to innovative processes and product optimization. Its targeted product development leverages innovative ingredients and ADM's existing portfolio across different segments. The R&D team is also engaged in BioSolutions initiatives which are a key part of ADM's commitment to utilize its value chain to reduce its carbon footprint, redesign core products with sustainable alternatives, and explore new markets.","zh":"該公司的研發工作重點是創造符合食品安全、永續流程、健康和個人化營養宏觀趨勢的科學為基礎的產品、解決方案和技術。在橫跨三大洲的創新中心內，研發團隊與客戶和全球市場緊密相連。該公司利用其創新流程和產品優化的優勢，對整個營養價值鏈的研發進行策略性投資。其目標產品開發利用創新成分和 ADM 跨不同細分市場的現有產品組合。研發團隊也參與了 BioSolutions 計劃，這是 ADM 致力於利用其價值鏈減少碳足跡、用永續替代品重新設計核心產品以及探索新市場的承諾的關鍵部分。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Ag Servicesand Oilseeds","val":61571000000,"zh":"農業服務和油籽"},{"name":"Carbohydrate Solutions","val":10737000000,"zh":"碳水化合物溶液"},{"name":"Nutrition","val":7512000000,"zh":"營養"}],"total":80269000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":31175000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"CH","val":17793000000,"zh":"CH"},{"name":"Other Foreign","val":15227000000,"zh":"其他國外"},{"name":"KY","val":6093000000,"zh":"肯塔基州"},{"name":"BR","val":3358000000,"zh":"BR"},{"name":"MX","val":2741000000,"zh":"墨西哥"},{"name":"GB","val":2115000000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"CA","val":1767000000,"zh":"加拿大"}],"total":80269000000}},"peers":["BG","HRL","CAG","APD","CL"]}}